SUMMARY:Wilket Creek\, Serena Grundy\, Sunnybrook\, Edwards Garden AND Str
 etching!
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\n**MeetUp Point: James for Ent
 rance is off Leslie Street. Turn left on Leslie to Parking Lot 2 in Wilket
 t Creek Park**\n(Don't follow the pin!)\n\n**Join James for a 12 km hike t
 hat is challenging!**\n\nStarting past Wilcott Parking Lot 2\, we will be 
 passing through a number of parks and hills.\nFor lunch we can stop at the
  TBG Bloom cafe for lunch or coffee ---- you might need one\; or bring you
 r own lunch.\nWe will finish the hike with much needed yoga streches.\nIt 
 might be muddy\, so ensure you have proper footwear!\nAlso layers please\,
  as we are heading into cooler weather!
