SUMMARY:Halloween Dance Party and Scavenger Hunt
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\n**It's a Halloween Dance Part
 y and Scavenger Hunt!**\n\n**Location: Party Room 51 Trolley Crescent**\n*
 *(Scavenger Hunt is under the bridge)**\n\n**Fee:**\n**$20 by October 19th
 ******\n**$25 from October 20th to 28th**\n**Send to**\n**boots4hikingthsi
 x@gmail.com**\n\n**Party Details**\n***Theme**: Unmask your hidden self.*\
 n*** Vibe*: Grown-up drinks\, killer costumes\, and zero filters.\n\n**Dro
 p the mask and let your true monster out to play this Halloween.**\nPrize 
 for best costume!\nEvery day we wear the mask of the professional\, the po
 lite\, and the responsible. Not tonight. This Halloween\, it’s time to s
 hed your civilized skin and unleash your **real personality**—no filters
 \, no judgements\, just pure\, unadulterated fun.\nCome as who you *actual
 ly* are on the inside.\n🖤 The Ritual\n\n*** Date: **Saturday\, October 
 31st\, 2026\n*** Time: **7:00 PM until the spirits fade**\n*** Lair: We ar
 e just confirming the venue. We will keep you posted!\n\n🍷 The Elements
 \n\n*** Potions & Brews: **Drinks and nibbles provided!\n*** Attire: **Cos
 tumes required. Dress as your inner alter-ego\, your deepest obsession\, o
 r the version of you that only comes out after dark.\n*** The Vibe: **Dark
  beats\, heavy pours\, and wicked company.\nADMISSION IS $20\,\n\nAre you 
 brave enough to show your true colours?
